### Smart Loan Tracker API - Loan Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-firebase-id-token-here
@borrowerId = some-borrower-uid
@loanId = loan-id-from-create-response

### Create Loan (As Lender)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "borrowerId": "{{borrowerId}}",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "reason": "Rent assistance",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### Get All Loans (As Lender)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans?role=lender
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Specific Loan
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Accept Loan (As Borrower - Switch Token!)
# Note: You need the borrower's token here
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Add Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200,
  "note": "First installment"
}

### Get Loan Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
